│                          │ deterministic structured seed configuration (boundary + interior lattice) inside the      │
│                          │ equilateral triangle, (2) run a fixed-seed simulated annealing optimizer whose objective  │
│                          │ is the normalized minimum triangle area over all 165 point triplets, computed vectorized  │
│                          │ with NumPy. The architecture is modularized into separate helper functions (area          │
│                          │ computation, boundary projection, annealing loop), improving maintainability while        │
│                          │ keeping the same zero-argument signature and (11,2) ndarray output.                       │
