│                          │ focuses the smooth surrogate on the ~20 binding (smallest) triplet areas instead of       │
│                          │ diluting the gradient over all 165 triples — this sharpens convergence; (3) a slightly    │
│                          │ wider deterministic multi-start set (hand-crafted barycentric seed + fixed-seed random    │
│                          │ logits); (4) a short gradient-informed perpendicular polish only as a cheap final         │
│                          │ touch-up (kept only if it improves), and a barycentric repair/validity check with         │
│                          │ hardcoded fallback for robustness. Temperature annealing over three scales (relative to   │
│                          │ the triangle area) lets Powell first smooth the landscape then sharpen to the true min.   │
│                          │ This keeps runtime near the faster parent while aiming for a higher min-area.             │
