│                          │ recomputing areas of triples containing the moved point), augmented with guided           │
│                          │ perpendicular moves on the worst triplet, boundary-heavy warm starts (vertices + lattices │
│                          │ + edge points), and a phase-2 merge polish over the top-3 configurations. This is far     │
│                          │ faster than full-batch evaluation and Powell optimization, allowing many more restarts    │
