│ patch_description        │ Structural redesign as a staged hybrid optimizer: alternating (a) Powell smooth-softmin   │
│                          │ stages over the full 33-dim logit parametrization (global, keeps feasibility) and (b)     │
│                          │ discrete worst-triplet refinement that finds the argmin triplet, optimizes only that      │
│                          │ triplet's points with a softmin objective, and geometrically pushes each of the three     │
│                          │ points perpendicular to the opposite edge. A best-config registry tracks the true         │
│                          │ (non-smooth) min-area across all stages, and results from Powell runs feed directly into  │
│                          │ triplet polishing, importing the runner-up's incremental triple-aware efficiency.         │
│                          │ Time-budgeted (~8s), deterministic seeds, hardcoded fallback for safety.                  │
